#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We simulate each AQC-compiled circuit using the `StatevectorEstimator` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Sini-simulate natin ang bawat AQC-compiled circuit gamit ang `StatevectorEstimator` primitive.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We now extract the expectation value $\\langle\\sigma_i^z\\rangle$ for every qubit $i$ at each time step $t$. These values form the retarded Green's function matrix $G^R(j, j_c, t)$. Then, we Fourier-transform the RGF into the dynamical structure factor $S(q, \\omega)$ and plot both the RGF and the DSF. `get_dsf` applies mirror symmetry and clips negative values internally.\n"
msgstr "Kinukuha na natin ngayon ang expectation value na $\\langle\\sigma_i^z\\rangle$ para sa bawat qubit $i$ sa bawat time step $t$. Ang mga halagang ito ay bumubuo ng retarded Green's function matrix na $G^R(j, j_c, t)$. Pagkatapos, ino-Fourier-transform natin ang RGF papunta sa dynamical structure factor na $S(q, \\omega)$ at ipinapakita ang parehong RGF at DSF sa graph. Ang `get_dsf` ay naglalapat ng mirror symmetry at pinuputol ang mga negatibong halaga internally.\n"

